Former French prime minitser Gabriel Attal, also a candidate in the 2027 presidential election, has filed a legal complaint alleging "foreign interference originating from Russian networks" after discovering he was the target of several deepfakes, fake news videos and fake newspaper front pages earlier this week.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/65635316-25a2-11f0-80ee-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-04-29T140948Z_954268298_RC299Y97ALTY_RTRMADP_3_FRANCE-RUSSIA-CYBERSECURITY.JPG"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/65635316-25a2-11f0-80ee-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-04-29T140948Z_954268298_RC299Y97ALTY_RTRMADP_3_FRANCE-RUSSIA-CYBERSECURITY.JPG" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c6693d2e-930b-11f1-b6de-6109cceefb43</guid><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 09:46:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/65635316-25a2-11f0-80ee-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2025-04-29T140948Z_954268298_RC299Y97ALTY_RTRMADP_3_FRANCE-RUSSIA-CYBERSECURITY.JPG">REUTERS - Dado Ruvic</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>Revamp of French parliament building faces criticism over cost and heritage</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260807-revamp-of-french-parliament-building-faces-criticism-over-cost-and-heritage</link><description>
Plans to modernise visitor facilities at the French National Assembly have become a battleground, with opponents questioning both the €53 million price tag and the proposed design.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f90dfe96-925b-11f1-a1f7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/France-National-Assembly.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f90dfe96-925b-11f1-a1f7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/France-National-Assembly.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">56effad0-9259-11f1-93b6-a9a9022b58cb</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 14:51:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f90dfe96-925b-11f1-a1f7-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/France-National-Assembly.jpg">© PHILIPPE TURPIN / PHOTONONSTOP / AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>Pope Leo XIV to meet survivors of clerical abuse during September visit to France</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260807-pope-leo-xiv-to-meet-abuse-survivors-during-september-visit-to-france</link><description>
Pope Leo XIV will meet privately with survivors of clerical sexual abuse during a four-day visit to France next month. On Friday, the Vatican published the itinerary for the 25–28 September trip – the first papal state visit to the country since Benedict XVI visited in 2008.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a919bb62-34d9-11f1-8abb-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-A7D49ZR.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a919bb62-34d9-11f1-8abb-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-A7D49ZR.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">065720b0-925b-11f1-98cd-15ecfd29aa41</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 13:31:16 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/a919bb62-34d9-11f1-8abb-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-A7D49ZR.jpg">AFP - HANDOUT</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>French unemployment hits six-year high as jobless total reaches 2.7 million</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260807-unemployment-in-france-hits-a-six-year-high-of-2-7-million-people</link><description>
The number of unemployed people in France rose to 2.7 million in the second quarter of 2026, pushing the jobless rate to its highest level in nearly six years, according to the national statistics agency Insee.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c03f6cde-923e-11f1-8c80-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/jos-1.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c03f6cde-923e-11f1-8c80-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/jos-1.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">60479a44-9235-11f1-8dcb-ada1b72c7d88</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 09:48:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/c03f6cde-923e-11f1-8c80-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/jos-1.jpg">AP - Nicolas Garriga</source><dc:creator>Paul Myers</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>'People at war have come to help': Ukrainian firefighters battle French wildfire</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260807-people-at-war-have-come-to-help-ukrainian-firefighters-battle-french-wildfire</link><description>
A team of 70 firefighters from Ukraine is on deployment in southwest France, where wildfires have scorched 42,000 hectares in the worst blaze in decades. RFI met the Ukrainian rescuers helping to put out the last of the flames.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e305f8ce-904e-11f1-9907-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/IMG-2027.jpeg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e305f8ce-904e-11f1-9907-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/IMG-2027.jpeg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">dcd68664-919b-11f1-820b-7f942ad1b252</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 06:09:48 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/e305f8ce-904e-11f1-9907-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/IMG-2027.jpeg">© Pierre Olivier / RFI</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>Threats by Corsican separatist group FLNC-UC trigger anti-terrorism inquiry</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260806-threats-by-corsican-separatist-group-flnc-uc-trigger-anti-terrorism-inquiry</link><description>
A masked appearance by armed Corsican separatists and threats made against people moving to the island from mainland France has reignited tensions over the Mediterranean island’s political future, amid growing concerns about intimidation and violence.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f1fef7ee-917b-11f1-9507-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Corsica-FLNC-2006.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f1fef7ee-917b-11f1-9507-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Corsica-FLNC-2006.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">fb26eab0-916d-11f1-9f24-1f94adf76d39</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 11:29:46 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/f1fef7ee-917b-11f1-9507-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Corsica-FLNC-2006.jpg">© AFP</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>New Caledonia races to avoid shutdown as new government takes office</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260806-new-caledonia-races-to-avert-shutdown-as-new-government-takes-office</link><description>
New Caledonia’s 19th government formally took office on Wednesday after its 11 members unanimously agreed on the allocation of portfolios, with the immediate task of securing €109 million by the end of August to avoid a complete shutdown of the local administration.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d9650e24-90ce-11f1-9fd5-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C3MC9WM.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d9650e24-90ce-11f1-9fd5-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C3MC9WM.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">0721baa6-90cf-11f1-be84-e9eaf3a775e3</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 06:00:48 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/d9650e24-90ce-11f1-9fd5-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C3MC9WM.jpg">AFP - DELPHINE MAYEUR</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>France</category><title>Ex-French PM Attal targeted by Russian 'interference' ahead of 2027 vote</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/france/20260805-ex-french-pm-attal-targeted-by-russian-interference-ahead-of-2027-vote</link><description>
Gabriel Attal, France’s former prime minister and Renaissance party leader, has been targeted by “foreign interference originating in Russia”, in the latest in a series of Kremlin‑linked operations aimed at destabilising the 2027 presidential election.
